承诺做个好市民！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75FBB1C1321F6BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223423008:1":{"text":"그렇다면 폭발은 어떻게 된 거지?","source_cn":"所以，那个爆炸是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BCA5E41D7677F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223423009:1":{"text":"레나타의 짓입니다.","source_cn":"是雷纳塔干的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD34077899954688E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223423010:1":{"text":"물귀신파의 레나타? 너희와 한패 아니던가?","source_cn":"是水鬼帮的雷纳塔？和你们一伙的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6B134A4842E529F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223423011:1":{"text":"아니요. 죽음의 함대가 패배한 뒤, 레나타는 성실하게 살기 싫다면서 우리와 갈라섰습니다.","source_cn":"不，死潮舰队被打败后，雷纳塔不想本分工作，我们就不是一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8514B37B4313251C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223423012:1":{"text":"이번 폭발도 우리에게 누명을 씌운 것이고요!","source_cn":"这次爆炸也是她栽赃我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x828275E08E84FB6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_